{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的 S11（22秒）和 S12（25秒）叙事句与感受提示相对密集，即使感受按音乐时点出现，仍可能让观众来不及兼顾文字和音乐；X 对应段落更疏朗。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用加亮短语让观众迅速抓住每段叙事的核心，再用交替出现的感受提示把心理变化与音乐细节联系起来，不必读完所有文字也能跟上故事。更重要的是，Y 把想念亲近、不甘心受委屈、害怕孤独、最终带着想念继续生活这条心理脉络串得更清楚，音乐感受也细致到了力度、节奏、音色、身体反应和情绪转折。少数短时段信息偏密，是它比较明显的代价。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "872fe988-555d-4c48-a97c-c901b05e871c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T002015279312Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:20:56.749747+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4bd15aac9a93345011e1b50c8ee2bb90b5d0f6a098bb04682178788a755d9e2b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp